WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.369
Operational security begins with protecting the workstation itself.

00:00:04.369 --> 00:00:08.277
Apply operating-system, browser, application, and extension updates.

00:00:08.277 --> 00:00:17.704
Use supported endpoint protection, a host firewall, screen locking, and physical safeguards appropriate to the sensitivity of the work.

00:00:17.704 --> 00:00:25.292
Use unique passwords stored in an approved password manager and enable multi-factor authentication where available.

00:00:25.292 --> 00:00:29.200
Recovery methods should be controlled and documented.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:37.248
Do not place case credentials, API keys, or sensitive notes in browser scripts or unprotected files.

00:00:37.248 --> 00:00:49.434
A VPN can protect traffic on untrusted networks and provide an approved organizational connection, but it does not guarantee anonymity or make prohibited activity acceptable.

00:00:49.434 --> 00:00:53.343
Providers and destinations may still log information.

00:00:53.343 --> 00:01:00.010
Choose and use network services according to policy and the investigation's legitimate need.

00:01:00.010 --> 00:01:07.138
Separate personal accounts and identifiers from research workflows to reduce contamination and accidental disclosure.

00:01:07.138 --> 00:01:15.185
This is basic compartmentation, not permission to impersonate people, create deceptive access, or enter private communities.

00:01:15.185 --> 00:01:17.255
Minimize unnecessary exposure.

00:01:17.255 --> 00:01:26.222
Collect only what the requirement needs, avoid publishing sensitive findings broadly, and restrict case material to authorized users.

00:01:26.222 --> 00:01:33.350
Public information can still create privacy, safety, and reputational harm when aggregated or mishandled.

00:01:33.350 --> 00:01:37.258
Legal and ethical boundaries govern the workstation.

00:01:37.258 --> 00:01:44.846
Do not bypass access controls, use stolen credentials, harass, doxx, stalk, or conduct unlawful surveillance.

00:01:44.846 --> 00:01:51.514
When authority is unclear, pause and seek policy, privacy, legal, or supervisory review.
